_vrf_PLAT230_mc4si_rt_2
;
PROBLEM: Hirshfeld Test Diff for    I10      --C9       .       14.7 s.u.  
RESPONSE: The difference is due to temperature-induced vibrations of the carbon atoms that are away from the tethering ammonium group. While such differences can be removed by constrained refinement, in the authors' view, these anisotropic displacement parameters represent true nature of these hybrid structures at room temperature.
;
_vrf_PLAT360_mc4si_rt_2
;
PROBLEM: Short  C(sp3)-C(sp3) Bond  C8       - C9       .       1.32 Ang.  
RESPONSE: The short distance is due to temperature-induced vibrations of the carbon atoms that are away from the tethering ammonium group. 
;
